Mr. Deepak Bhasin, learned Senior Advocate for the appellants/plaintiffs submitted that no plea was taken by the defendants regarding the acquisition of the land;
therefore, the findings recorded by the learned First Appellate Court will not affect the rights of the parties.
Mr. Navlesh Verma, learned Additional Advocate General submitted that the findings recorded by learned First Appellate Court clearly show that the suit land was acquired by the State of H.P.; therefore, the plaintiffs cannot be granted any benefit.
